cloud-architecture-diagram
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode plain
typeface clean

Users [icon: users, label: "Admin and Recruiters"]
GitHub [icon: github]

AWS [icon: aws, color: orange] {
  Edge {
    CloudFront [icon: aws-cloudfront]
    WebBucket [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "Private React origin"]
    ALB [icon: aws-elb-application-load-balancer]
  }

  VPC [icon: aws-vpc] {
    API [icon: aws-fargate, label: "Spring Boot API"]
    Worker [icon: aws-fargate, label: "Spring Boot Worker"]
  }

  Async {
    Queues [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "SQS and DLQ"]
  }

  Storage {
    Quarantine [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "Private quarantine"]
    Files [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "Private resumes/exports"]
    Registry [icon: aws-elastic-container-registry]
  }

  SecurityOps {
    Secrets [icon: aws-secrets-manager]
    Observability [icon: aws-cloudwatch]
  }
}

External {
  Supabase [icon: database, label: "Portable PostgreSQL\nSupabase hosted"]
  Drive [icon: google-drive, label: "Public Drive PDF source"]
  Scanner [label: "Malware scanner"]
  Grok [label: "xAI Grok\nquery interpretation only"]
}

Users > CloudFront
CloudFront > WebBucket: Static assets
CloudFront > ALB: /api/*
ALB > API
API <> Supabase: TLS PostgreSQL
API > Files: Authorized five-minute GET
API > Queues: Opaque work reference
Queues > Worker: Async work
Worker <> Supabase: Durable job state
Worker > Drive: Rate-limited PDF fetch
Worker > Quarantine: Untrusted content
Worker > Scanner: Require clean result
Worker > Files: Promote clean PDF/export
API > Grok: Query plus restricted DSL only
GitHub > Registry: Immutable images
Registry > API, Worker
API, Worker > Secrets, Observability

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [connection: >, label: Synchronous]
  [color: orange, label: AWS boundary]
}
